    "base_semantics_changed": false,
    "summary": [
      "Retained the 0.4.0 compatible CRT idempotent splitting, 1000-adic completion and unique infinite positional expansion",
      "Added the two-channel arithmetic of radix 1000=2^3*5^3, including unit criteria, residue geometry and carry laws under explicit assumptions",
      "Added the ten-layer K3-M finite-profile morphology, with open questions and finite-catalogue limitations retained",
      "Added explicit ordered expression and directed block composition semantics, separate from integer addition",
      "Added typed applied mathematical models and traceability for DAK, Reaper and VentuSample without claiming source-project implementation",
      "Added a 41-record claim/evidence registry, JSON Schema and CI contract validator for syntax modes, theorem scope, dependencies and the 4685-record catalogue.",
      "Added guarded ecosystem documentation synchronization that opens reviewable Draft PRs for five allowlisted repositories; secret availability and external dispatch remain unverified."
    ]
  },
